name: sim.registerScriptFuncHook
description: Registers a script function hook for callback functions, that will be executed before or after the specified function. Calling this function a second time with the same arguments will unregister a previous hook
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.registerScriptFuncHook(string funcToHook, string userFunc, bool execBefore)
inputs:
1. funcToHook: function to hook
2. userFunc: user function
3. execBefore: if true, the user function is called before the function to hook. Otherwise it is called after
outputs:
1. result: 1 if the hook registration was successful, or 0 if a previous hook was removed
replacedBy:
- name: registerFunctionHook, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_registerFunctionHook.method
- name: removeFunctionHook, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_removeFunctionHook.method
